# Mayor Arse — gives the water quest (Chesburg, house 3). Format: dialogue/dialogue_parser.gd
@speaker Mayor Arse

# Most advanced story state first.
@when quest_done_water_for_the_desert -> thanks
@when water_quest_accepted -> reminder

== offer ==
[i]Oh dear[/i]...[pause=0.8] [i]you[/i] actually came!
> What did you call me here for? -> info

== info ==
[sad][i]My[/i] old friend, [color=#a86f00]Mayor Cox[/color][/sad], from the [wave][color=#a86f00]Desert Town[/color][/wave] has told [i]me[/i] that her [whisper]little[/whisper] [color=#a86f00]town[/color] has been suffering from a month-long drought.
> So? -> info_2

== info_2 ==
It [shake]would[/shake] be great help [bounce]diplomatically[/bounce] if you can, deliver some of our [color=#1a5fb4]water spirits[/color] to their town to sell them.
> Wait, what spirits? -> water_spirit_info
> Why me specifically? -> why_me_info

== why_me_info ==
[i]I[/i] am giving [i]you[/i] something to do? Shouldn't [i]you[/i] be like[pause=0.8], [rainbow]happy[/rainbow] to get orders from [i]me[/i]?
> Ughhhh, fine -> accepted [set water_quest_accepted]
> No? -> rejected

== water_spirit_info ==
In [i]my[/i] well. [i]I[/i] have had them for a long time, [i]plenty[/i] in fact. They are the [i]reason[/i] why [i]we[/i] never have to worry about [color=#1a5fb4]water[/color] problems.
> But why me? -> why_me_info

== rejected ==
[shake]N-[pause=0.5]No?[/shake][pause=0.8] Listen [i]my[/i] dear! What [i]I[/i], am doing is [i]giving[/i] you an opportunity to prove [i]your[/i] worth to this [color=#a02020]town[/color].
> Ughhhh, fine -> accepted [set water_quest_accepted]

== accepted ==
[give lantern] Splendid! Take this [color=#9a6b00]lantern[/color], jump into the well and keep going down. The spirits are at the very bottom. Bring [color=#1a5fb4]them[/color] to the [wave][color=#a86f00]Desert Town[/color][/wave]'s [color=#a86f00]mayor[/color] and tell her [color=#9a6b00]200 gold[/color] each.

== reminder ==
Still here? Jump into the well and keep going down. The spirits are at the very bottom. Bring [color=#1a5fb4]them[/color] to the [wave][color=#a86f00]Desert Town[/color][/wave]'s [color=#a86f00]mayor[/color] and tell her [color=#9a6b00]200 gold[/color] each.

== thanks ==
The desert has water again, thanks to you. Chesburg is proud. Take a rest. You've earned it.
